WEBVTT

01:10.440 --> 01:15.160
XUE LI, COURTESY NAME FANGFEI

01:20.160 --> 01:21.000
Dear.

01:23.880 --> 01:25.080
Dear.

01:31.040 --> 01:32.520
- Who are you?
- Dear.

01:33.000 --> 01:33.840
Dear.

01:33.920 --> 01:35.400
Get off me.

01:35.480 --> 01:36.400
Let go!

01:44.440 --> 01:47.120
SHEN RUYUN, MRS. SHEN

01:57.560 --> 01:59.560
- You bitch!
- I'm not…

02:00.120 --> 02:01.240
Xue Li.

02:01.840 --> 02:04.160
You dirty and shameless bitch!

02:08.520 --> 02:09.680
Xue Li.

02:10.240 --> 02:11.080
Xue Li.

02:35.440 --> 02:38.440
SHEN BINGXIU, COURTESY NAME YURONG

02:39.040 --> 02:41.360
Dear, you're here at last.

02:43.840 --> 02:45.360
I was set up.

02:45.960 --> 02:47.640
Mother and Yurong are mistaken.

02:48.600 --> 02:50.120
We've been married for so many years.

02:51.640 --> 02:53.240
You should know me.

02:59.040 --> 03:00.120
Dear.

03:00.200 --> 03:01.040
You…

03:04.440 --> 03:05.960
You don't believe me either?

03:17.720 --> 03:18.840
Let's go.

05:32.920 --> 05:34.800
You know I was set up.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.000
Who did it?

05:49.760 --> 05:50.600
Was it you?

05:52.320 --> 05:53.440
Or was it your mother?

05:55.080 --> 05:56.480
Was it your sister?

05:58.320 --> 05:59.200
Shen Yurong.

06:00.200 --> 06:01.960
I'm not a clingy person.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.760
One letter of divorce from you

06:06.200 --> 06:07.720
and I would be gone.

06:08.920 --> 06:11.160
But why are you so cruel?

06:11.840 --> 06:14.520
You want to destroy my reputation

06:15.640 --> 06:17.640
and kill me here too.

06:18.400 --> 06:19.240
Xue Li.

06:21.560 --> 06:22.840
I have no choice.

06:24.720 --> 06:26.160
She could have crushed us

06:27.920 --> 06:30.160
like ants.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.000
Who?

06:44.160 --> 06:45.080
Xue Li.

06:47.320 --> 06:48.320
Close your eyes.

06:50.080 --> 06:50.920
Shen Yurong.

06:51.600 --> 06:52.520
Shen Yurong!

06:52.600 --> 06:53.920
How dare you do this to me?

06:54.000 --> 06:56.080
Aren't you afraid my father and brother

06:56.160 --> 06:57.560
wouldn't spare you?

07:00.840 --> 07:04.520
You'll reunite with them soon enough.

07:06.760 --> 07:07.600
Shen Yurong.

07:10.440 --> 07:11.440
What happened to them?

07:12.320 --> 07:14.040
Duke Xue was sentenced to death

07:15.400 --> 07:17.040
for corruption.

07:18.200 --> 07:21.200
Xue Zhao ran into bandits
on his way to visit you.

07:21.920 --> 07:24.040
He died a horrible death.

07:26.880 --> 07:28.360
Was it your doing?

07:29.800 --> 07:30.880
Was it?

07:32.200 --> 07:34.200
Why are you doing this to me?

07:35.320 --> 07:36.280
I'm sorry.

07:39.680 --> 07:40.920
I have failed you

07:43.080 --> 07:45.080
in this life.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.000
Father.

07:50.160 --> 07:51.520
Xue Zhao.

07:54.640 --> 07:55.480
Father.

07:56.920 --> 07:57.760
Xue Zhao…

10:31.240 --> 10:32.280
Stop.

10:37.920 --> 10:39.440
Your feet are dirty.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.600
Are you upset that I called you dirty?

10:47.680 --> 10:48.640
WANNING, ELDEST PRINCESS

10:48.720 --> 10:49.760
Come here.

10:55.120 --> 10:57.120
Tell me what you did tonight.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.840
I handled

11:01.600 --> 11:02.600
Xue Fangfei.

11:03.480 --> 11:05.000
How did you handle her?

11:05.920 --> 11:07.000
I buried her alive.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.800
You buried her alive?

11:09.880 --> 11:12.120
I just wanted to demote her to a concubine

11:12.200 --> 11:13.440
while I become your wife.

11:13.520 --> 11:16.360
That way, she could serve us forever.

11:16.440 --> 11:18.960
How could you be so cruel?

11:21.200 --> 11:24.600
Didn't you order my mother and sister

11:25.960 --> 11:28.040
to ruin her reputation

11:30.200 --> 11:32.680
to force me to kill her?

11:34.280 --> 11:39.200
That's right,
I set up everything last night.

11:40.080 --> 11:42.280
You have no idea how powerful

11:43.040 --> 11:44.680
the Eldest Princess is.

11:45.160 --> 11:46.960
I had to intervene for you.

11:47.920 --> 11:49.760
If you don't kill Xue Fangfei,

11:49.840 --> 11:52.640
our entire family will die tomorrow!

11:54.960 --> 11:56.440
The choice is yours.

12:03.040 --> 12:05.680
Do you want to defend her
from an injustice?

12:08.600 --> 12:09.560
No.

12:12.880 --> 12:13.720
Smile.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.680
Why aren't you smiling?

12:19.360 --> 12:21.000
Feeling sorry for your wife?

12:21.080 --> 12:21.960
Stop it.

12:26.320 --> 12:28.200
Mr. Shen.

12:28.280 --> 12:29.960
I'm not into murderers.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.440
As the Eldest Princess,

12:33.520 --> 12:35.760
I'm concerned about
the suffering of women and children.

12:37.080 --> 12:42.040
I must punish
a ruthless heartbreaker like you.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.160
Wanning!

12:44.880 --> 12:46.560
What exactly do you want from me?

12:48.480 --> 12:50.440
You're a murderer now.

12:51.600 --> 12:52.760
Only I can save you.

12:53.680 --> 12:54.760
Beg me.

12:59.480 --> 13:01.240
- I'm begging you.
- Kneel!

13:16.960 --> 13:17.960
Good boy.

13:20.720 --> 13:22.080
Tell me.

13:22.920 --> 13:25.840
How did your wife react

13:26.320 --> 13:27.560
when she was being buried?

13:29.480 --> 13:31.200
Did she curse at you

13:31.680 --> 13:33.160
or did she grovel?

13:34.640 --> 13:37.320
Or did she accept death

13:38.040 --> 13:39.280
out of love for you?

13:40.400 --> 13:41.800
Stop pushing me.

13:41.880 --> 13:43.920
At most, we can both die.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.680
Can you bear to kill me?

13:53.560 --> 13:54.680
Can you?

14:18.240 --> 14:21.960
You're my beloved Mr. Shen indeed.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.840
So imposing.

14:28.360 --> 14:30.400
Your wife has just passed away.

14:30.480 --> 14:32.200
You have to take care of the funeral,

14:33.680 --> 14:35.000
so you have a lot to do.

14:36.200 --> 14:38.160
Quit kneeling in my palace.

14:38.920 --> 14:40.360
Hurry home,

14:41.840 --> 14:43.080
my prince consort.

15:41.800 --> 15:44.760
DUKE SU, XIAO HENG

15:56.560 --> 15:57.720
Why are you all standing here?

15:58.200 --> 15:59.320
Are you waiting for a reward?

15:59.800 --> 16:00.880
Are you?

16:11.680 --> 16:13.600
Duke Su.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.200
Mr. Jia.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.560
I'm in a good mood today,

16:18.040 --> 16:19.320
so I'll only ask you once.

16:20.520 --> 16:23.480
Who do you source
the salt you're trafficking?

16:24.520 --> 16:26.920
Whoever kills Duke Su gets a big reward!

16:38.200 --> 16:41.480
Run!

17:18.880 --> 17:19.720
Duke Su,

17:19.800 --> 17:21.319
please spare my life.

17:21.400 --> 17:23.440
My lord, let me take care of him.

17:23.520 --> 17:25.000
After a few days in the dungeons,

17:25.079 --> 17:27.160
I'll relay what you want to know,

17:27.240 --> 17:29.120
so he won't pollute your ears.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.360
I'll tell you.

17:30.440 --> 17:32.480
I'll confess everything.

17:32.560 --> 17:34.320
Please spare me, Duke Su.

17:35.680 --> 17:36.520
I…

17:36.600 --> 17:37.720
Out with it.

17:41.640 --> 17:42.640
I…

17:44.280 --> 17:45.560
After him.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.360
Mr. Qin supplied them.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.120
Where can we find him?

17:53.200 --> 17:54.360
I don't know, he's always on the move.

17:54.440 --> 17:55.560
Where's the next transaction?

17:55.640 --> 17:56.960
Helin Temple, Qingcheng Mountain.

17:57.040 --> 17:58.960
- When?
- On the mid-month ceremony.

17:59.040 --> 18:01.120
What about the dirty money
and salt you're trafficking?

18:02.080 --> 18:02.920
I'll hand them in

18:03.000 --> 18:04.080
with the fine.

18:04.840 --> 18:05.800
I'll hand them in.

18:07.800 --> 18:08.640
Mr. Jia,

18:09.520 --> 18:10.360
well done.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.160
Anything else you want to know?

18:12.760 --> 18:13.680
He's useless to me now.

18:15.680 --> 18:16.600
He's all yours.

18:21.240 --> 18:24.040
CAPITAL OF GREAT YAN

18:30.880 --> 18:32.840
BENEFITTING THE PEOPLE

18:33.960 --> 18:34.800
Watch out.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.240
My lord, I lost him.

18:49.800 --> 18:51.080
Since they wanted to silence him,

18:51.160 --> 18:53.720
it means there's a big fish
behind this salt trafficking case.

18:53.800 --> 18:54.920
Let's go home first.

18:55.560 --> 18:57.680
We'll visit Helin Temple
in the middle of the month.

18:58.560 --> 19:00.920
The Seal

19:01.600 --> 19:04.400
of the Yellow God

19:05.080 --> 19:08.160
brings souls

19:08.240 --> 19:11.080
toward reincarnation.

19:18.400 --> 19:20.680
COFFIN OF HANLIN ACADEMY
SCHOLAR'S WIFE, MS. XUE

19:40.920 --> 19:42.880
Mr. Shen is such a devoted husband.

19:43.480 --> 19:46.280
A few days ago,
his wife eloped with another man

19:46.360 --> 19:47.640
and died at Qingcheng Mountain,

19:47.720 --> 19:49.320
causing quite a stir.

19:50.320 --> 19:52.400
Now he's even a pallbearer.

19:52.960 --> 19:54.320
His wife was the most talented girl

19:54.400 --> 19:56.080
in all of Huaixiang.

19:56.160 --> 19:58.640
What a shame.

19:58.720 --> 20:00.480
Shut it. Show some respect for the dead.

20:02.360 --> 20:04.240
My lord, why are you smiling?

20:05.040 --> 20:06.040
Because you're stupid.

20:06.920 --> 20:09.160
- What do you mean?
- You can't judge a book by its cover.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.640
- What a fool.
- I'm not stupid.

20:11.720 --> 20:12.560
I'm smart.

20:28.680 --> 20:30.560
My lady, we'd better pick up the pace.

20:30.640 --> 20:33.240
It's almost sundown.
We'll get beaten again if we're late.

20:42.840 --> 20:43.680
My lady.

20:45.120 --> 20:47.440
JIANG RUOYU, COURTESY NAME LI

20:47.520 --> 20:49.600
TONG'ER

21:22.760 --> 21:23.760
Who are you?

21:28.120 --> 21:29.080
What do you want?

21:29.160 --> 21:30.040
Go away.

21:30.880 --> 21:31.920
My lady.

21:32.000 --> 21:33.400
Miss, don't be afraid.

21:33.480 --> 21:34.760
My name is Jiang Li.

21:34.840 --> 21:36.080
This is Tong'er, my maid.

21:36.560 --> 21:37.560
We're here to help you.

21:38.560 --> 21:39.880
You fainted by the river.

21:40.440 --> 21:41.440
Do you remember?

21:42.000 --> 21:43.280
Who sent you?

21:45.400 --> 21:46.240
What do you want?

21:54.000 --> 21:54.840
Hey,

21:54.920 --> 21:55.760
you're so funny.

21:55.840 --> 21:57.440
She's the chancellor's daughter.

21:57.520 --> 21:58.680
Why would she harm you?

22:01.160 --> 22:03.800
Miss, how are you feeling?

22:04.560 --> 22:05.640
Have some water.

22:07.840 --> 22:08.880
Miss, don't be afraid.

22:09.480 --> 22:10.720
We're not bad people.

22:11.320 --> 22:12.160
Go away.

22:14.640 --> 22:15.640
Leave me alone.

22:16.400 --> 22:17.720
Go away.

22:17.800 --> 22:18.760
Go!

22:20.680 --> 22:22.040
Calm down first.

22:22.120 --> 22:23.760
We'll find you some wild fruits.

22:45.280 --> 22:46.120
Because of him,

22:47.080 --> 22:48.560
you're even forsaking your own father?

22:52.000 --> 22:53.120
Father,

22:55.480 --> 22:57.040
please let us be together.

22:59.160 --> 23:01.520
Duke Xue, I swear

23:01.600 --> 23:03.360
as long as I, Shen Yurong, am alive,

23:04.000 --> 23:05.760
I will not let Xue Li suffer.

23:06.760 --> 23:08.600
Officials in the capital

23:08.680 --> 23:11.880
are extremely greedy.

23:15.920 --> 23:17.720
Xue Li stood by me for years

23:17.800 --> 23:19.560
when I was a poor, unknown scholar.

23:19.640 --> 23:21.480
I'm well-known now

23:22.320 --> 23:23.480
and I'll establish myself

23:24.240 --> 23:25.920
to protect Xue Li.

23:26.480 --> 23:27.760
Please rest assured, Duke Xue.

23:30.480 --> 23:32.640
Father, please give
Xue Li your permission.

23:53.040 --> 23:54.480
Miss, what are you doing?

23:54.560 --> 23:55.720
Let go.

23:55.800 --> 23:56.880
- Let go of me.
- Miss.

23:56.960 --> 23:57.960
- Let me die.
- Miss.

23:58.040 --> 23:59.320
- Let me die.
- Miss.

24:00.080 --> 24:01.280
Regardless of what happened,

24:01.360 --> 24:02.760
what matters is you're alive.

24:02.840 --> 24:04.840
As long as you're alive,
you can start over.

24:08.080 --> 24:09.560
Start over?

24:13.640 --> 24:14.560
I don't deserve that.

24:15.600 --> 24:17.760
I'm a blind,

24:17.840 --> 24:19.160
ignorant fool

24:20.360 --> 24:22.480
who brought this upon myself.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.600
I don't deserve to be alive.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.520
Miss,

24:26.600 --> 24:28.160
don't blame yourself for being blind.

24:28.720 --> 24:29.920
Blame the ones who failed you.

24:30.480 --> 24:32.920
Why punish yourself for their misdeeds?

24:33.000 --> 24:34.360
What do you know?

24:35.400 --> 24:36.320
Miss.

24:36.400 --> 24:38.320
Someone I trusted let me down too.

24:38.840 --> 24:40.640
I know how you feel.

24:40.720 --> 24:42.120
Do you know what they're afraid of?

24:43.320 --> 24:44.600
They're afraid that you're alive,

24:45.280 --> 24:47.200
that we're keen and alert

24:47.880 --> 24:49.120
to witness their end.

24:50.320 --> 24:52.360
Living is the best revenge against those

24:53.320 --> 24:54.440
who want your demise.

25:09.000 --> 25:10.640
Miss, we have to go.

25:11.560 --> 25:14.200
We'll find a chance to bring you
some food and medicine tomorrow.

25:15.240 --> 25:16.480
Keep the veil.

25:37.360 --> 25:39.440
FILIAL PIETY, VIRTUOUS,
FAITHFUL, UNSWERVING

25:44.560 --> 25:48.520
ZHENNV HALL

26:00.000 --> 26:01.480
GINSENG LUNG-CLEARING PILL

26:12.200 --> 26:13.040
Wait.

26:16.640 --> 26:20.360
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

26:20.440 --> 26:22.560
There's no need to collect firewood today.

26:22.640 --> 26:25.120
But Chief asked us
to collect half a month's worth.

26:25.200 --> 26:27.320
Wait until the trees are less humid

26:28.280 --> 26:29.360
in a few days.

27:15.560 --> 27:17.760
My lady,
if someone catches you sneaking out,

27:17.840 --> 27:19.000
you'll get beaten.

27:19.080 --> 27:20.600
Don't risk it.

27:21.600 --> 27:23.160
All right, I won't go.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.480
Go back to sleep.

27:25.560 --> 27:28.080
All right. My lady, get some rest too.

28:06.840 --> 28:11.280
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

28:11.360 --> 28:14.120
Sneaking out in the middle of the night.

28:15.040 --> 28:15.880
Jiang Li,

28:16.560 --> 28:17.880
what were you up to?

28:18.760 --> 28:22.440
NON-ENVY, DISCIPLINE,
CHASTITY, RIGHTEOUSNESS

28:24.360 --> 28:25.320
You're refusing to talk?

28:25.400 --> 28:26.880
Then you're twice as guilty!

28:28.040 --> 28:29.320
My lady!

28:29.800 --> 28:30.800
My lady.

28:30.880 --> 28:32.080
Tong'er.

28:32.160 --> 28:33.000
Don't hit Tong'er.

28:33.080 --> 28:33.920
Hit me instead.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.160
- Take her away!
- My lady!

28:35.720 --> 28:36.560
- Tong'er.
- No!

28:36.640 --> 28:37.840
- Tong'er, get up.
- My lady!

28:37.920 --> 28:40.280
My lady!

28:41.200 --> 28:42.040
Be honest,

28:42.120 --> 28:44.920
were you going to meet your lover?

28:45.920 --> 28:46.800
No.

28:46.880 --> 28:48.160
- No.
- You still won't confess?

28:48.240 --> 28:51.760
Stop it!

28:53.360 --> 28:55.600
Hit me instead.

28:56.880 --> 29:01.880
My lady. Let me go!

29:01.960 --> 29:03.080
Jiang Li,

29:03.160 --> 29:05.600
Sneaking out is an impure act.

29:06.400 --> 29:08.200
You've tainted Zhennv Hall's reputation.

29:09.040 --> 29:11.880
I want all of you to hit her.

29:13.080 --> 29:14.080
- Yes.
- Hit me instead!

29:14.160 --> 29:16.080
Hit me!

29:16.160 --> 29:17.760
I'm begging you. My lady!

29:18.560 --> 29:19.800
My lady!

29:19.880 --> 29:24.320
- Repent.
- Stop it.

29:24.400 --> 29:26.280
Hit me instead.

29:26.360 --> 29:27.360
Hit her.

29:28.160 --> 29:30.080
- Come here.
- My lady!

29:31.040 --> 29:33.040
Let me go!

29:33.120 --> 29:34.200
My lady!

29:37.840 --> 29:38.680
Hit her.

29:38.760 --> 29:42.120
Don't hit her, please.

29:42.920 --> 29:44.400
Stop it.

29:45.840 --> 29:47.120
My lady.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.320
I'm letting you all participate

29:49.400 --> 29:50.880
as a reminder

29:51.760 --> 29:52.880
that the impure

29:53.360 --> 29:55.040
will be punished,

29:55.120 --> 29:56.360
no one will be spared.

29:57.520 --> 29:58.680
Hit her hard!

29:58.760 --> 30:00.520
Stop it.

30:04.600 --> 30:06.120
My lady.

30:10.760 --> 30:12.360
Stop it.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.760
Stop!

30:15.960 --> 30:17.880
Stop hitting her.

30:19.040 --> 30:21.480
My lady!

30:32.080 --> 30:32.920
Miss,

30:33.400 --> 30:35.440
don't blame yourself for being blind.

30:35.520 --> 30:36.840
Blame the ones who failed you.

30:37.600 --> 30:39.840
Why punish yourself for their misdeeds?

30:40.760 --> 30:42.320
Regardless of what happened,

30:42.400 --> 30:43.880
what matters is you're alive.

30:44.600 --> 30:46.360
As long as you're alive,
you can start over.

30:47.160 --> 30:48.520
Do you know what they're afraid of?

30:49.080 --> 30:50.560
They're afraid that you're alive,

30:50.640 --> 30:52.600
that we're keen and alert

30:53.120 --> 30:54.440
to witness their end.

31:04.400 --> 31:05.760
I need to stay alive.

31:06.600 --> 31:08.440
I must live on.

31:08.520 --> 31:10.760
FILIAL PIETY, VIRTUOUS,
FAITHFUL, UNSWERVING

31:21.240 --> 31:25.880
ZHENNV HALL

31:38.640 --> 31:40.000
Everyone's collecting fruits.

31:40.080 --> 31:41.480
Why didn't Ms. Jiang go?

31:41.560 --> 31:43.080
She can't even leave her bed

31:43.160 --> 31:44.480
after she got beaten up yesterday.

31:44.560 --> 31:45.520
From now on,

31:45.600 --> 31:47.000
we might have to pick up her slack.

31:47.080 --> 31:48.520
It serves her right for sneaking out.

31:48.600 --> 31:50.120
I wonder who she was seeing.

31:50.200 --> 31:52.400
She deserves it.
She's probably meeting a man.

32:18.240 --> 32:25.160
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

32:34.760 --> 32:35.600
Tong'er.

32:40.600 --> 32:41.680
Tong'er.

32:42.360 --> 32:43.200
Where's Jiang Li?

32:43.280 --> 32:45.120
If she didn't want to bring you food,

32:45.200 --> 32:46.600
this wouldn't have happened to her.

32:46.680 --> 32:47.600
Get out.

33:06.360 --> 33:07.240
Jiang Li.

33:16.280 --> 33:17.200
Jiang Li.

33:25.760 --> 33:26.640
Jiang Li.

33:27.760 --> 33:28.760
Miss.

33:29.400 --> 33:31.120
What are you doing here?

33:31.200 --> 33:32.400
You're not safe here.

33:33.880 --> 33:34.760
Go.

33:35.920 --> 33:36.760
Jiang Li.

33:39.600 --> 33:42.080
You shouldn't have risked your life
to bring me things.

33:46.360 --> 33:48.040
When I first came here,

33:49.160 --> 33:50.680
I also tried taking my own life.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.400
If it weren't for Tong'er,

33:54.600 --> 33:56.360
I might be dead by now.

33:57.560 --> 33:58.600
Seeing you

33:59.120 --> 34:00.920
reminds me of myself.

34:02.160 --> 34:03.600
When one feels hopeless,

34:04.560 --> 34:06.600
one hopes someone will reach out,

34:07.880 --> 34:09.800
so I thought I'd reach out to you.

34:11.159 --> 34:12.760
It's only a beating.

34:13.920 --> 34:16.040
It's not as if
I've never been beaten up before.

34:16.880 --> 34:18.760
But why do I feel

34:19.400 --> 34:20.880
so drowsy this time?

34:27.760 --> 34:28.760
Jiang Li.

34:30.320 --> 34:31.239
Miss,

34:32.960 --> 34:35.280
am I dying soon?

34:35.360 --> 34:37.000
Jiang Li, hang in there.

34:37.960 --> 34:39.800
I'll go down this mountain

34:39.880 --> 34:40.840
and ask the Jiang family

34:40.920 --> 34:41.760
to come get you.

34:42.840 --> 34:43.960
Miss.

34:49.719 --> 34:50.960
When I saved you,

34:51.520 --> 34:52.760
I was hoping

34:53.360 --> 34:55.560
you could deliver a message to my family.

34:55.639 --> 34:56.719
Tell my father

34:58.360 --> 34:59.640
I've had enough.

35:00.680 --> 35:02.000
I was wrong.

35:03.080 --> 35:05.400
I don't want to stay here any longer.

35:07.000 --> 35:10.040
But now, it seems like

35:11.920 --> 35:12.880
it's too late.

35:13.440 --> 35:14.280
It's not too late.

35:14.360 --> 35:15.520
Just hang in there.

35:16.160 --> 35:17.120
Miss.

35:18.520 --> 35:21.000
They accused me
of killing my mother and younger brother.

35:22.680 --> 35:23.560
I didn't do it.

35:24.760 --> 35:26.360
I really didn't.

35:28.760 --> 35:30.880
TEN YEARS AGO

35:31.880 --> 35:34.680
Mother, I'll make you
some chrysanthemum tea.

35:34.760 --> 35:35.720
That day, I brought

35:35.800 --> 35:37.760
the chrysanthemums I planted to my mother.

35:38.880 --> 35:39.960
She complimented them,

35:40.760 --> 35:43.320
so I wanted to bring her
to Fangfei Pavilion to admire them

35:44.040 --> 35:45.760
and make some chrysanthemum tea for her.

35:45.840 --> 35:47.840
Mother, where are you going?

35:54.760 --> 35:55.800
But…

36:05.720 --> 36:06.920
Hurry, somebody!

36:07.000 --> 36:08.360
Help Madam up.

36:08.840 --> 36:10.280
- Madam.
- Madam, are you all right?

36:10.360 --> 36:11.240
- Madam.
- Goodness.

36:11.320 --> 36:13.080
Help Madam up.

36:13.160 --> 36:14.400
Let me see.

36:14.480 --> 36:15.440
Excuse me.

36:15.520 --> 36:16.600
Let me see.

36:16.680 --> 36:17.600
Madam, there's blood.

36:17.680 --> 36:18.680
Madam, it's blood.

36:18.760 --> 36:19.600
It's blood!

36:19.680 --> 36:20.560
Blood.

36:20.640 --> 36:21.800
Madam, are you all right?

36:21.880 --> 36:22.880
- It looks serious.
- You…

36:23.360 --> 36:24.240
Jiang Li,

36:24.320 --> 36:25.840
I treated you kindly.

36:26.880 --> 36:28.880
Why did you do this to me?

36:29.560 --> 36:30.960
My stepmother was kind to me

36:31.480 --> 36:32.760
and she was known to be virtuous.

36:33.680 --> 36:35.240
I was once glad

36:35.320 --> 36:36.840
to be her daughter.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.640
Never would I have thought

36:40.160 --> 36:41.600
- that her accusation
- Hurry!

36:42.160 --> 36:43.440
- that day
- Go!

36:44.160 --> 36:46.080
would make everyone think of me as someone

36:46.760 --> 36:48.640
who tried to kill my mother and brother.

36:53.280 --> 36:54.160
After that,

36:55.440 --> 36:57.640
I've been confined
to Zhennv Hall for ten years.

36:59.320 --> 37:00.960
Ten years.

37:03.720 --> 37:05.840
No matter how hard I tried to explain,

37:06.960 --> 37:08.520
no one listened.

37:09.520 --> 37:10.960
No one believed me.

37:12.360 --> 37:13.640
I believe you.

37:16.840 --> 37:19.040
I believe you're not that kind of person.

37:19.920 --> 37:20.760
Miss.

37:21.720 --> 37:24.200
I've told you everything about myself.

37:25.960 --> 37:28.000
Please just do me a favor.

37:28.080 --> 37:29.840
You don't need to beg me.

37:31.160 --> 37:32.840
You rescued me from the swamp.

37:33.440 --> 37:35.560
I'll do anything for you.

37:36.920 --> 37:38.040
In the past ten years,

37:39.280 --> 37:41.720
I've never left Zhennv Hall.

37:43.480 --> 37:46.000
No one in the Jiang family
asked about me either

37:46.680 --> 37:47.600
or came to see me.

37:48.560 --> 37:50.280
Perhaps to them,

37:51.760 --> 37:53.480
I'm already dead.

37:56.440 --> 37:58.360
Besides the people here,

37:58.440 --> 38:01.240
no one knows what I look like.

38:06.440 --> 38:10.840
My mother gave me this hairpin.

38:13.400 --> 38:15.480
This can prove my identity.

38:17.200 --> 38:18.080
Miss.

38:19.520 --> 38:20.560
Please…

38:22.400 --> 38:23.680
Please bring it

38:27.240 --> 38:28.520
to my father.

38:30.240 --> 38:31.080
Tell him

38:32.280 --> 38:37.280
I'm suffering greatly
and filled with resentment here,

38:38.640 --> 38:40.200
but I've done nothing wrong.

38:41.440 --> 38:43.560
I never did anything wrong.

38:45.560 --> 38:46.640
I hate him.

38:47.320 --> 38:49.360
I hate the entire Jiang family.

38:50.720 --> 38:52.280
Even in the netherworld,

38:53.280 --> 38:58.280
I would curse them all to a tragic end.

39:06.720 --> 39:07.560
Jiang Li.

39:08.400 --> 39:09.520
You said it yourself.

39:10.840 --> 39:12.360
Living is the best revenge.

39:13.560 --> 39:14.480
Hang in there.

39:16.360 --> 39:18.280
You must carry on.

39:25.320 --> 39:27.440
Jiang Li, what are you doing?

39:53.920 --> 39:55.160
I planted this pear tree

39:55.240 --> 39:56.680
when I first came here.

39:57.480 --> 39:59.440
It never blossomed before.

40:18.360 --> 40:23.000
YE ZHENZHEN, JIANG YUANBAI'S FIRST WIFE

40:28.360 --> 40:29.200
Mother?

40:30.760 --> 40:31.960
- Li'er.
- Mother.

40:32.680 --> 40:34.000
Have you come to pick me up?

40:36.200 --> 40:37.520
I miss you so much.

41:16.480 --> 41:17.560
It's so beautiful.

41:49.880 --> 41:50.880
My lady.

41:54.040 --> 41:54.920
My lady.

41:56.960 --> 41:59.400
My lady, wake up.

41:59.960 --> 42:01.080
Wake up.

42:09.160 --> 42:10.320
My lady.

42:11.040 --> 42:13.360
My lady, wake up.

42:14.040 --> 42:16.000
The heavens sure like to play jokes.

42:19.360 --> 42:20.400
The innocent…

42:21.360 --> 42:22.400
My lady.

42:23.080 --> 42:24.760
…are suffering here,

42:26.960 --> 42:28.480
- My lady.
- while the wicked

42:30.400 --> 42:32.880
go unpunished.

42:34.280 --> 42:36.240
My lady…

43:02.760 --> 43:03.600
Chief.

43:04.480 --> 43:06.680
Jiang Li should not stop working.

43:07.640 --> 43:09.360
She's still in bed at this hour.

43:10.600 --> 43:12.200
It was only a few hits

43:12.280 --> 43:14.000
and now she's pretending to be sick.

43:14.080 --> 43:15.680
I'll kill them

43:15.760 --> 43:17.400
and make them pay
for her ladyship's death.

43:20.160 --> 43:21.320
What are you doing?

43:21.400 --> 43:22.880
Do you want to avenge her?

43:25.840 --> 43:26.720
Then listen to me.

43:28.880 --> 43:29.920
The heavens are unjust.

43:31.560 --> 43:32.480
I'll seek justice

43:33.680 --> 43:35.040
for us.

43:41.840 --> 43:44.000
How dare you sleep in the day
and not work?

43:44.080 --> 43:45.040
Quit pretending.

43:45.640 --> 43:46.480
Get up.

43:51.360 --> 43:52.200
Jiang Li.

44:10.680 --> 44:11.520
Who are you?

44:12.160 --> 44:13.000
I am…

44:14.160 --> 44:15.320
your benefactor.

44:15.960 --> 44:17.400
Nonsense.

44:17.960 --> 44:20.200
What's your relationship with Jiang Li?

44:20.280 --> 44:21.840
Shouldn't you be worried

44:23.000 --> 44:24.480
about the one who's killing her?

44:25.360 --> 44:26.400
I see.

44:27.040 --> 44:30.000
So you killed an official's daughter.

44:30.080 --> 44:31.600
I'm going to report you.

44:31.680 --> 44:32.960
Have you forgotten?

44:33.040 --> 44:34.160
You girls beat her to death.

44:34.840 --> 44:36.280
Even the authorities need a witness.

44:36.760 --> 44:38.640
Everyone here can testify

44:39.680 --> 44:41.040
that you, the outsider

44:41.120 --> 44:42.840
who broke into Zhennv Hall,

44:43.520 --> 44:44.400
killed her.

44:44.480 --> 44:46.280
Your testimonies are nothing

44:46.360 --> 44:47.560
compared to hers.

44:49.080 --> 44:50.320
Come and see for yourself.

44:51.520 --> 44:52.400
Look.

44:52.960 --> 44:54.880
The dead can't lie.

44:54.960 --> 44:56.440
Her body is covered in wounds,

44:57.000 --> 44:58.760
including countless scars over the years.

44:59.360 --> 45:00.400
When the autopsy comes out,

45:01.120 --> 45:02.560
can the Zhennv Hall get away with it?

45:02.640 --> 45:03.800
Let go of me!

45:03.880 --> 45:05.400
When the Jiang family claims her body,

45:05.480 --> 45:07.440
you girls will be tied up
to kneel in her mourning hall.

45:07.520 --> 45:08.600
Let go of me.

45:08.680 --> 45:10.960
The Chief Secretariat's daughter
dies in Zhennv Hall.

45:11.760 --> 45:13.760
Do you really think
you'll get away with it?

45:15.280 --> 45:17.000
I have a perfect solution.

45:18.000 --> 45:18.840
What is it?

45:19.760 --> 45:21.080
Starting today,

45:22.360 --> 45:23.280
I…

45:24.000 --> 45:25.440
will be Jiang Li.
